{{!
    @template oksigenia/mail

    The common e-mail of the Oksigenia plugins, in the brand of the centre that sends it: a band in its colour with its
    logo on a white plate and its name (or a picture across the top), the stripe of its colours, the letter on white
    paper, and a foot that says who writes, why it arrives and, when it goes to many, how to stop it. Tables and styles
    in line, the only thing every mail program respects; 600 pixels at most. Light by default in the elements' own
    styles, with near white paper, so a program that darkens a mail by itself takes it as its background; the dark of
    the centre in the style block, for the programs that ask (Apple Mail, iOS, Outlook) and for Outlook.com. The logo
    keeps its white plate in every mode: inverted or dark, it never disappears. No remote image: the pictures go inside
    the mail (cid:). The plain text version is mail.txt.mst, with the same words. Both are .mst, never .mustache: they
    keep the table attributes Outlook needs, which the Moodle CI rejects in any .mustache of a plugin.

    The colours come from letter::build() (letter.php); every text arrives already in the language of the
    reader. Keys inside a block never repeat a key of the root: Mustache would take the root's when the block has none.
    For the same reason a list is never walked inside its own «list.0» section: that section puts the first item on
    the stack, and a later item without «bold» would take the first one's. The «.0» sections only open and close
    the box.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lang, dir, start, end - the language; ltr or rtl; left and right (or the reverse)
    * subject, preheader - the subject (the title of the page) and the hidden line mail programs show before opening
      (its invisible filler, three repeats only: more reads as hidden text, which Hotmail scores)
    * brand - name, unit (who writes inside the centre, or empty), site and siteurl (its address), or empty
    * logo - logocid, logowidth, logoheight, wordmark (the logo already says the name); or false
    * hero - herocid, herowidth, heroheight, heroalt: a picture across the top, over the band; herobrand, when the
      picture already carries the brand (a greeting with the logo drawn in), and then it goes without the band; or false
    * colours, dark - the colours by day and at night: page, wall, card, band, bandink, soft, ink, ink2, title, link,
      accent, button, buttonink, line, border
    * hasstripe, stripe, stripetop - the stripe of the brand, only with two colours or more: n, colour, night. Under the
      band goes stripetop, without the main colour, which is the band's; the whole stripe goes at the foot, and under a
      picture that carries the brand
    * heading, hello - the title of the mail; the greeting, or empty
    * blocks - one key each, in the order given:
        paragraph (text) · rich (runs: run, bold) · subheading (text) · data (rows: label, value) · items (texts) ·
        note (notetitle, notetext) · code (text: a code to type by hand) · picture (picturecid, picturewidth, pictureheight, picturealt, picturecaption, pictureframe) ·
        action (actionurl, actiontext) · link (linkbefore, linkurl, linktext; linkbare, set by mail.php when the text
        is the address) · small (text)
    * signature - signoff, signer, signrole; or false
    * contact, reason - the foot: how to reach the centre (address, telephone, mail), why this mail arrives
    * unsub - unsuburl, unsubtext, unsubhint: only in mails to many, with List-Unsubscribe in the headers; or false
    * sample - a line under the card, only in samples; or empty

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lang": "es", "dir": "ltr", "start": "left", "end": "right",
        "subject": "Un número se ha unido a tu cuenta", "preheader": "Desde hoy, tus avisos también llegan por WhatsApp.",
        "brand": {"name": "Colegio Los Arces", "unit": "Secretaría", "site": "losarces.example",
            "siteurl": "https://losarces.example"},
        "logo": {"logocid": "logo", "logowidth": 44, "logoheight": 44, "wordmark": false}, "hero": false,
        "colours": {"page": "#F3F4F6", "wall": "#E9EFED", "card": "#FFFFFF", "band": "#1F5A4E", "bandink": "#FFFFFF",
            "soft": "#F1F5F4", "ink": "#1E2523", "ink2": "#57605E", "title": "#1F5A4E", "link": "#1F5A4E",
            "accent": "#1F5A4E", "button": "#1F5A4E", "buttonink": "#FFFFFF", "line": "#D2DEDB", "border": "#B9C2C0"},
        "dark": {"page": "#0F1715", "wall": "#0F1715", "card": "#16201E", "band": "#1F5A4E", "bandink": "#FFFFFF",
            "soft": "#1F2927", "ink": "#EFF1F1", "ink2": "#B1B9B7", "title": "#D3E1DE", "link": "#8FC2B6",
            "accent": "#5E9D8F", "button": "#5E9D8F", "buttonink": "#0B0B0F", "line": "#323B39", "border": "#55605D"},
        "hasstripe": true,
        "stripe": [{"n": 1, "colour": "#1F5A4E", "night": "#5E9D8F"}, {"n": 2, "colour": "#E0A526", "night": "#E0A526"}],
        "stripetop": [{"n": 2, "colour": "#E0A526", "night": "#E0A526"}],
        "heading": "Un número se ha unido a tu cuenta", "hello": "Hola, Marta:",
        "blocks": [
            {"paragraph": "Desde hoy, los avisos de la plataforma también te llegan a este número."},
            {"rich": [{"run": "Lo ha añadido "}, {"run": "Marta Ruiz", "bold": true}, {"run": "."}]},
            {"subheading": "El número"},
            {"data": [{"label": "Número", "value": "+34 600 000 412"}, {"label": "Por", "value": "WhatsApp"}]},
            {"items": ["Las notas", "Los avisos del tutor"]},
            {"note": {"notetitle": "Ojo", "notetext": "Solo llegan los avisos que tienes encendidos."} },
            {"picture": {"picturecid": "pic", "picturewidth": 520, "pictureheight": 260, "picturealt": "La tarjeta",
                "picturecaption": "Así se ve en el móvil."} },
            {"action": {"actionurl": "https://losarces.example/avisos", "actiontext": "Ver mis avisos"} },
            {"link": {"linkbefore": "También puedes", "linkurl": "https://losarces.example/canales",
                "linktext": "elegir qué avisos te llegan"} },
            {"small": "Si no has sido tú, quita el número desde tu cuenta."}
        ],
        "signature": {"signoff": "Un saludo,", "signer": "Secretaría", "signrole": "Colegio Los Arces"},
        "contact": "Calle de los Arces 14, Valle Alto · +34 900 000 014",
        "reason": "Te llega porque tienes cuenta en la plataforma del Colegio Los Arces.",
        "unsub": {"unsuburl": "https://losarces.example/baja", "unsubtext": "Darme de baja",
            "unsubhint": "¿Prefieres no recibir estos correos?"},
        "sample": ""
    }
}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{lang}}" dir="{{dir}}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" content="yes">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no, url=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>{{subject}}</title>
<!--[if mso]>
<noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:AllowPNG/><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript>
<style>
table, td, p, a, h1, h2, span, strong { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif !important; }
table { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
.om-gap { mso-line-height-rule: exactly; }
.om-btn { mso-padding-alt: 15px 30px; }
.om-btn-a { mso-padding-alt: 0; }
</style>
<![endif]-->
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
body { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; }
img { border: 0; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; }
a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; }
[dir="rtl"] * { letter-spacing: 0 !important; }
@media (max-width: 620px) {
    .om-outer { padding: 0 !important; }
    .om-card, .om-round { border-radius: 0 !important; }
    .om-pad { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }
    .om-h1 { font-size: 24px !important; }
    .om-dt, .om-dd { display: block !important; width: auto !important; }
    .om-dt { padding-bottom: 0 !important; }
    .om-dd { padding-top: 2px !important; padding-{{start}}: 16px !important; }
    .om-btnwrap { width: 100% !important; }
    .om-btn-a { display: block !important; text-align: center !important; }
    .om-pic { width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; }
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    .om-page { background-color: {{colours.wall}} !important; }
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .om-page { background-color: {{dark.page}} !important; }
    .om-card { background-color: {{dark.card}} !important; }
    .om-soft { background-color: {{dark.soft}} !important; }
    .om-ink { color: {{dark.ink}} !important; }
    .om-ink2 { color: {{dark.ink2}} !important; }
    .om-title { color: {{dark.title}} !important; }
    .om-link { color: {{dark.link}} !important; }
    .om-note { border-color: {{dark.accent}} !important; }
    .om-bullet { background-color: {{dark.accent}} !important; }
    .om-btn { background-color: {{dark.button}} !important; }
    .om-btn-a { color: {{dark.buttonink}} !important; }
    .om-line { background-color: {{dark.line}} !important; }
    .om-baja { border-color: {{dark.border}} !important; color: {{dark.link}} !important; }
    .om-frame { border-color: {{dark.line}} !important; }
{{#stripe}}
    .om-s{{n}} { background-color: {{night}} !important; }
{{/stripe}}
}
[data-ogsb] .om-page { background-color: {{dark.page}} !important; }
[data-ogsb] .om-card { background-color: {{dark.card}} !important; }
[data-ogsb] .om-soft { background-color: {{dark.soft}} !important; }
[data-ogsc] .om-ink { color: {{dark.ink}} !important; }
[data-ogsc] .om-ink2 { color: {{dark.ink2}} !important; }
[data-ogsc] .om-title { color: {{dark.title}} !important; }
[data-ogsc] .om-link { color: {{dark.link}} !important; }
[data-ogsb] .om-btn { background-color: {{dark.button}} !important; }
[data-ogsc] .om-btn-a { color: {{dark.buttonink}} !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="om-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:{{colours.page}};">
<!--[if !mso]><!--><div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;color:{{colours.page}};">{{preheader}}&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;</div><!--<![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="om-page" style="width:100%;background-color:{{colours.page}};">
<tr><td align="center" class="om-outer" style="padding:28px 12px;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" dir="{{dir}}" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="om-card" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background-color:{{colours.card}};border-radius:12px;text-align:{{start}};">
{{#hero}}
<tr><td class="om-round" style="padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;"><img src="cid:{{herocid}}" width="{{herowidth}}" height="{{heroheight}}" alt="{{heroalt}}" class="om-round" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:{{colours.bandink}};background-color:{{colours.band}};"></td></tr>
{{/hero}}
{{^hero.herobrand}}
<tr><td class="om-pad om-round" bgcolor="{{colours.band}}" style="padding:18px 40px;background-color:{{colours.band}};border-radius:{{^hero}}12px 12px 0 0{{/hero}}{{#hero}}0{{/hero}};">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
{{#logo}}
<td style="padding:0;padding-{{end}}:14px;vertical-align:middle;"><img src="cid:{{logocid}}" width="{{logowidth}}" height="{{logoheight}}" alt="{{#wordmark}}{{brand.name}}{{/wordmark}}" class="om-logo" style="display:block;border:0;border-radius:10px;"></td>
{{/logo}}
{{^logo.wordmark}}
<td style="padding:0;vertical-align:middle;">
<p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:{{colours.bandink}};">{{brand.name}}</p>
{{#brand.unit}}<p style="margin:2px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;color:{{colours.bandink}};">{{brand.unit}}</p>{{/brand.unit}}
</td>
{{/logo.wordmark}}
{{#logo.wordmark}}{{#brand.unit}}
<td style="padding:0;vertical-align:middle;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:{{colours.bandink}};">{{brand.unit}}</p></td>
{{/brand.unit}}{{/logo.wordmark}}
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
{{/hero.herobrand}}
{{#hasstripe}}
<tr><td style="padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr>
{{#hero.herobrand}}{{#stripe}}<td class="om-s{{n}} om-gap" height="6" bgcolor="{{colour}}" style="height:6px;padding:0;background-color:{{colour}};font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>{{/stripe}}{{/hero.herobrand}}
{{^hero.herobrand}}{{#stripetop}}<td class="om-s{{n}} om-gap" height="6" bgcolor="{{colour}}" style="height:6px;padding:0;background-color:{{colour}};font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>{{/stripetop}}{{/hero.herobrand}}
</tr></table></td></tr>
{{/hasstripe}}
<tr><td class="om-pad" style="padding:34px 40px 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<h1 class="om-title om-h1" style="margin:0 0 18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:27px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:{{colours.title}};">{{heading}}</h1>
{{#hello}}<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{hello}}</p>{{/hello}}
{{#blocks}}
{{#paragraph}}<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{paragraph}}</p>{{/paragraph}}
{{#rich.0}}<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{/rich.0}}{{#rich}}{{#bold}}<strong style="font-weight:700;">{{run}}</strong>{{/bold}}{{^bold}}{{run}}{{/bold}}{{/rich}}{{#rich.0}}</p>{{/rich.0}}
{{#subheading}}<h2 class="om-title" style="margin:26px 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:{{colours.title}};">{{subheading}}</h2>{{/subheading}}
{{#data.0}}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="om-soft" bgcolor="{{colours.soft}}" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 20px;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background-color:{{colours.soft}};border-radius:10px;">
<tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
{{/data.0}}
{{#data}}
<tr><td style="padding:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr>
<td class="om-dt om-ink2" width="132" style="width:132px;padding:7px 0 7px;padding-{{start}}:16px;vertical-align:top;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{label}}</td>
<td class="om-dd om-ink" style="padding:7px 16px 7px;padding-{{start}}:10px;vertical-align:top;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{value}}</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
{{/data}}
{{#data.0}}
<tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;padding:0;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
</table>
{{/data.0}}
{{#items.0}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 18px;">
{{/items.0}}
{{#items}}
<tr>
<td width="20" style="width:20px;padding:10px 0 0;vertical-align:top;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="om-bullet om-gap" width="7" height="7" bgcolor="{{colours.accent}}" style="width:7px;height:7px;padding:0;background-color:{{colours.accent}};border-radius:2px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td>
<td class="om-ink" style="padding:0 0 6px;vertical-align:top;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{.}}</td>
</tr>
{{/items}}
{{#items.0}}
</table>
{{/items.0}}
{{#note}}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 20px;"><tr>
<td class="om-soft om-note" bgcolor="{{colours.soft}}" style="padding:14px 18px;background-color:{{colours.soft}};border-{{start}}:4px solid {{colours.accent}};border-radius:4px 10px 10px 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
{{#notetitle}}<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{notetitle}}</p>{{/notetitle}}
<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{notetext}}</p>
</td></tr></table>
{{/note}}
{{#code}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 20px;border-collapse:separate;"><tr>
<td class="om-soft om-ink" dir="ltr" bgcolor="{{colours.soft}}" style="padding:14px 18px 14px 24px;background-color:{{colours.soft}};border-radius:10px;font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:{{colours.ink}};-webkit-user-select:all;user-select:all;">{{code}}</td>
</tr></table>
{{/code}}
{{#picture}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 20px;"><tr><td style="padding:0;">
<img src="cid:{{picturecid}}" width="{{picturewidth}}" height="{{pictureheight}}" alt="{{picturealt}}" class="om-pic om-soft om-ink2{{#pictureframe}} om-frame{{/pictureframe}}" style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;{{#pictureframe}}border:1px solid {{colours.line}};box-sizing:border-box;{{/pictureframe}}{{^pictureframe}}border:0;{{/pictureframe}}border-radius:10px;background-color:{{colours.soft}};font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:{{colours.ink2}};">
{{#picturecaption}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{picturecaption}}</p>{{/picturecaption}}
</td></tr></table>
{{/picture}}
{{#action}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="om-btnwrap" style="margin:8px 0 22px;border-collapse:separate;"><tr>
<td class="om-btn" align="center" bgcolor="{{colours.button}}" style="border-radius:10px;background-color:{{colours.button}};">
<a class="om-btn-a" href="{{actionurl}}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:{{colours.buttonink}};text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">{{actiontext}}</a>
</td></tr></table>
{{/action}}
{{#link}}<p class="om-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{#linkbefore}}{{linkbefore}} {{/linkbefore}}<a class="om-link" href="{{linkurl}}" target="_blank" style="font-weight:700;color:{{colours.link}};text-decoration:underline;">{{linktext}}</a></p>{{/link}}
{{#small}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{small}}</p>{{/small}}
{{/blocks}}
{{#signature}}
<p class="om-ink" style="margin:22px 0 2px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:{{colours.ink}};">{{signoff}}</p>
<p class="om-title" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:{{colours.title}};">{{signer}}</p>
{{#signrole}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{signrole}}</p>{{/signrole}}
{{/signature}}
</td></tr>
{{#hasstripe}}
<tr><td style="padding:18px 0 0;font-size:0;line-height:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr>
{{#stripe}}<td class="om-s{{n}} om-gap" height="4" bgcolor="{{colour}}" style="height:4px;padding:0;background-color:{{colour}};font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>{{/stripe}}
</tr></table></td></tr>
{{/hasstripe}}
{{^hasstripe}}
<tr><td class="om-pad" style="padding:18px 40px 0;font-size:0;line-height:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr><td class="om-line om-gap" height="1" bgcolor="{{colours.line}}" style="height:1px;padding:0;background-color:{{colours.line}};font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>
{{/hasstripe}}
<tr><td class="om-pad" style="padding:18px 40px 26px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:{{colours.ink2}};"><strong class="om-title" style="font-weight:700;color:{{colours.title}};">{{brand.name}}</strong>{{#brand.site}} · <a class="om-link" href="{{brand.siteurl}}" target="_blank" style="color:{{colours.link}};text-decoration:none;">{{brand.site}}</a>{{/brand.site}}</p>
{{#contact}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:2px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{contact}}</p>{{/contact}}
{{#reason}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{reason}}</p>{{/reason}}
{{#unsub}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{unsubhint}} <a class="om-baja" href="{{unsuburl}}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;margin:2px 0;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid {{colours.border}};border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;color:{{colours.link}};text-decoration:none;">{{unsubtext}}</a></p>{{/unsub}}
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
{{#sample}}<p class="om-ink2" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:{{colours.ink2}};">{{sample}}</p>{{/sample}}
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
